    "effect": {
      "before": "",
      "after": "<p><strong>Main action, ranged; 3 Bandwidth. His ONLY personal damage.</strong> Route a biofeedback spike back down the connection. Make a <strong>Cognition</strong> Power Roll. This ability affects <strong>only a wired / cybered / rigger / decker / active-drone target</strong> - a foe with no tech takes nothing. Biofeedback follows the node-tier table (Tier 5 base = 3). On <strong>Outcome Tier 1</strong> the target is also <strong>Dazed</strong>. The 'bit the security decker back' of the story - conditional by design; Null is a force multiplier, not a striker.</p>"
